<div class="container responsivegrid aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

    
    
    
    <div id="container-c3f6563a58" class="cmp-container">
        
        <div class="general-hero">
  
  
    <section class="cmp-general-hero carrier-container theme-surface-primary has-padding-top">
      <div class="cmp-general-hero__content">
        <!-- BE All content is optional, should be hidden if not authored -->
        
        
          <h1 class="cmp-general-hero__title">Carrier Transicold Installation Instructions for Truck and Trailer</h1>
        
        <div class="cmp-general-hero__inner-content">
          
            <p class="cmp-general-hero__description">Welcome to our installation resource center. Here, you’ll find a comprehensive library of installation drawings and documentation for Carrier Transicold truck, trailer, and rail refrigeration units, as well as accessories.</p>
          

          

        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cmp-general-hero__image">
        <picture class="cmp-general-hero__image-src">
          <!-- desktop -->
          <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://brandportal.carrier.com/transform/570e1dfe-1eea-4b19-9549-263cb937a33f/hero-carrier-transicold-installation"/>
          <!-- mobile -->
          <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://brandportal.carrier.com/transform/570e1dfe-1eea-4b19-9549-263cb937a33f/hero-carrier-transicold-installation"/>
          <img src="https://brandportal.carrier.com/transform/570e1dfe-1eea-4b19-9549-263cb937a33f/hero-carrier-transicold-installation" alt="Carrier Transicold Truck and Trailer Installation Guides"/>
        </picture>
      </div>
    </section>
  
</div>
<div class="text">






<div class="carrier-container theme-surface-primary">

  
    <div class="cmp-text theme-surface-primary cmp-text--regular has-padding-top has-padding-bottom" data-cmp-is="richtext">
      <div class="cmp-text__container">
        
          <h2 style="	text-align: left;
">How to Use This Page</h2>
<p>Click the tabs below to browse our categorized library of installation drawings. Each section includes downloadable PDFs and technical diagrams to support your installation process.</p>
<ul><li><b>Trailer and Rail Units: </b>X4 and Vector brand refrigeration units and Solara heating units</li><li><b>Trailer and Rail Options and Accessories: </b>Fuel, light and safety accessories for truck and rail; includes support for Lynx Fleet</li><li><b>Truck Units:</b> Neos, Supra, and Direct Drive truck refrigeration units</li><li><b>Truck Options and Accessories:</b> Heating, safety and conversion support for new and legacy models</li></ul>
<p>If the installation drawing you require is not listed below, please contact <a title="Send an Inquiry - Page metadata" href="/us/en/cold-chain/truck-trailer/contact-us/" aria-label="Send an Inquiry - Page metadata">Customer Service</a> for assistance. Our support team is ready to assist you with any installation-related inquiries.</p>

        
      </div>
    </div>
  

  
</div></div>
<div class="tabs panelcontainer">
<div id="tabs-84856bbae6" class="cmp-tabs carrier-grid carrier-container theme-surface-primary " data-cmp-is="tabs" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;tabs-84856bbae6&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[&#34;tabs-84856bbae6-item-8803ed75a0&#34;],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;carrier/components/content/tabs&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-06-18T13:53:36Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
