                        <h3 class="carousel-card__headline" id="card-title-0">TRU Battery Protection Program</h3>

                        <p class="carousel-card__text" id="card-desc-0">
                            Protect your Carrier Transicold Transport Refrigeration Unit (TRU) with TRU Battery Protection. This BluEdge™ program offers reliable battery coverage, including replacement and labor, with extended support when paired with solar charging. Maximize uptime, reduce costs and keep your cold chain moving.</p>

